    {
      "text": "01  PRINCIPLE &amp; TOOLKIT",
      "x": 100.0,
      "y": 775,
      "width": 1024.5249343832022,
      "height": 34.34275466998755,
      "font_size": 46,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 59,
      "latex": null
    },
    {
      "text": "A coalition witness reveals harmful additions:<br/>acceptable utility becomes unacceptable.",
      "x": 100.0,
      "y": 875,
      "width": 1024.5249343832022,
      "height": 85.60054794520548,
      "font_size": 39,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 100,
      "latex": null
    },
    {
      "text": "N: analyzed features; n = |N|; Uval(N) > 0; 0 < α ≤ 1",
      "x": 124.0,
      "y": 1020,
      "width": 976.5249343832022,
      "height": 32.16733250311332,
      "font_size": 32,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 42,
      "latex": "\\(N\\): analyzed features; \\(n=|N|,\\quad\\Uval(N)>0,\\quad 0<\\alpha\\leq1\\)."
    },
    {
      "text": "v<sub>α</sub>(S) = 1[U<sub>val</sub>(S) ≥ α U<sub>val</sub>(N)]",
      "x": 124.0,
      "y": 1074,
      "width": 976.5249343832022,
      "height": 42.22074221668743,
      "font_size": 42,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 64,
      "latex": "\\(\\displaystyle v_\\alpha(S)=\\mathbf{1}\\!\\left[\\Uval(S)\\geq\\alpha\\Uval(N)\\right]\\)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Δ<sub>i</sub>(S) = v<sub>α</sub>(S <font name=\"PosterMath\">∪</font> {i}) - v<sub>α</sub>(S)",
      "x": 124.0,
      "y": 1144,
      "width": 976.5249343832022,
      "height": 41.193773349937736,
      "font_size": 41,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 60,
      "latex": "\\(\\displaystyle\\Delta_i(S)=v_\\alpha(S\\cup\\{i\\})-v_\\alpha(S)\\)"
    },
    {
      "text": "MinPI<sub>i</sub> = MinSS<sub>i</sub> = MinBz<sub>i</sub> = min Δ<sub>i</sub>(S)",
      "x": 124.0,
      "y": 1214,
      "width": 976.5249343832022,
      "height": 65.92869738480697,
      "font_size": 38,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 86,
      "latex": "\\(\\displaystyle\\MinPI_i=\\MinSS_i=\\MinBz_i=\\min_{S\\subseteq N\\setminus\\{i\\}}\\Delta_i(S)\\)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Exact MinPI labels:",
      "x": 124.0,
      "y": 1308,
      "width": 976.5249343832022,
      "height": 22.553683686176836,
      "font_size": 31,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 38,
      "latex": null
    },
    {
      "text": "<b>-1 harmful:</b> some coalition flips 1 → 0.<br/><b>0 neutral:</b> all marginals ≥0; at least one is 0.<br/><b>+1 decisive:</b> every coalition flips 0 → 1.",
      "x": 124.0,
      "y": 1352,
      "width": 976.5249343832022,
      "height": 100.03121295143214,
      "font_size": 32,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 111,
      "latex": "\\textbf{\\(-1\\) harmful:} some coalition flips \\(1\\to0\\).\\\\\\textbf{\\(0\\) neutral:} all marginals \\(\\geq0\\); at least one is \\(0\\).\\\\\\textbf{\\(+1\\) decisive:} every coalition flips \\(0\\to1\\)."
    },
    {
      "text": "MinSS / MinBz: minimum Shapley-Shubik / Banzhaf.<br/>Both minima cover all coalitions; at most 2<super>n</super> utilities.",
      "x": 100.0,
      "y": 1490,
      "width": 1024.5249343832022,
      "height": 67.82810460772104,
      "font_size": 32,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 86,
      "latex": "MinSS / MinBz: minimum Shapley-Shubik / Banzhaf.\\\\Both minima cover all coalitions; exact uses at most \\(2^n\\) utilities."
    },
    {
      "text": "CORE TOOLS",
      "x": 100.0,
      "y": 1592,
      "width": 1024.5249343832022,
      "height": 29.628891656288914,
      "font_size": 40,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 51,
      "latex": null
    },
    {
      "text": "<b>MI (mutual information)</b> ranks feature-target dependence.<br/>A <b>maximum-weight absolute-correlation tree</b><br/>represents pairwise association and guides Algorithm B.",
      "x": 100.0,
      "y": 1658,
      "width": 1024.5249343832022,
      "height": 117.90815442092153,
      "font_size": 34,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 132,
      "latex": null
    },
    {
      "text": "<b>XGBoost:</b> 100 rounds, depth 4, learning rate 0.1;<br/>CUDA trees. Fit coalition models on training data.",
      "x": 100.0,
      "y": 1812,
      "width": 1024.5249343832022,
      "height": 74.90816438356165,
      "font_size": 34,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 89,
      "latex": null
    },
    {
      "text": "<b>Training-only preprocessing:</b> variance filtering →<br/>MI selection (≤100 features) → standardization.",
      "x": 100.0,
      "y": 1923,
      "width": 1024.5249343832022,
      "height": 74.90816438356165,
      "font_size": 34,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 89,
      "latex": null
    },
    {
      "text": "<b>Utility:</b> ROC AUC / one-vs-rest AUC / R².<br/>Uval(S): validation utility of train-fitted subset S.<br/>Empty coalition: training class priors / response mean.",
      "x": 100.0,
      "y": 2027,
      "width": 1024.5249343832022,
      "height": 112.309599003736,
      "font_size": 33,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 121,
      "latex": "\\textbf{Utility:} ROC AUC / one-vs-rest AUC / \\(R^2\\).\\\\\\(\\Uval(S)\\): validation utility of train-fitted subset \\(S\\).\\\\Empty coalition: training class priors / response mean."
    },
    {
      "text": "MATCHED-COUNT CONTROLS",
      "x": 100.0,
      "y": 2180,
      "width": 1024.5249343832022,
      "height": 28.147437110834375,
      "font_size": 38,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 49,
      "latex": null
    },
    {
      "text": "All controls delete the accepted MinPI count k.<br/><b>SHAP-bottom:</b> lowest mean |TreeSHAP| on train.<br/><b>MinShap / Banzhaf-bottom:</b> lowest minimum / mean<br/>continuous utility marginal from shared coalitions.<br/><b>Random:</b> 30 matched-count trials per seed.",
      "x": 100.0,
      "y": 2247,
      "width": 1024.5249343832022,
      "height": 185.26556413449563,
      "font_size": 32,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 200,
      "latex": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Quota sweep (seed 42): α in {0.85, 0.90, 0.95, 0.99}.",
      "x": 100.0,
      "y": 2465,
      "width": 1024.5249343832022,
      "height": 31.0000099626401,
      "font_size": 31,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 40,
      "latex": "Quota sweep (seed 42): \\(\\alpha\\in\\{0.85,0.90,0.95,0.99\\}\\)."
    },
    {
      "text": "02  ALGORITHM FLOW",
      "x": 1188.5249343832022,
      "y": 775,
      "width": 1024.5249343832022,
      "height": 34.050759651307594,
      "font_size": 46,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 59,
      "latex": null
    },
    {
      "text": "<b>Train 64% → validation 16% → test 20%</b><br/>Fit on train; compute the threshold game on validation.",
      "x": 1188.5249343832022,
      "y": 875,
      "width": 1024.5249343832022,
      "height": 73.96970361145704,
      "font_size": 33,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 89,
      "latex": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Algorithm A: size-uniform sampling",
      "x": 1212.5249343832022,
      "y": 1015,
      "width": 976.5249343832022,
      "height": 34.72362640099627,
      "font_size": 37,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 48,
      "latex": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Draw s uniformly from {0, ..., n-1}; then draw<br/>an s-feature subset uniformly from N <font name=\"PosterMath\">∖</font> {i}.",
      "x": 1212.5249343832022,
      "y": 1065,
      "width": 976.5249343832022,
      "height": 75.0,
      "font_size": 33,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 91,
      "latex": "Draw \\(s\\) uniformly from \\(\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\); then draw\\\\an \\(s\\)-feature subset uniformly from \\(N\\setminus\\{i\\}\\)."
    },
    {
      "text": "Algorithm B: MI-correlation guidance",
      "x": 1212.5249343832022,
      "y": 1215,
      "width": 976.5249343832022,
      "height": 34.27196014943961,
      "font_size": 37,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 48,
      "latex": null
    },
    {
      "text": "B<sub>i</sub>: top ≤10 tree neighbors by absolute correlation;<br/>pad from the top-MI half of N <font name=\"PosterMath\">∖</font> {i} toward min(20, floor(n/3)).<br/>Each draw: reset to B<sub>i</sub>; drop each independently (p = 0.3).<br/>Draw a uniformly from 0, ..., min(5, n-1);<br/>add up to a absent features from N <font name=\"PosterMath\">∖</font> {i} in random order.",
      "x": 1212.5249343832022,
      "y": 1265,
      "width": 976.5249343832022,
      "height": 199.96869738480697,
      "font_size": 33,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 225,
      "latex": "\\(B_i\\): up to 10 tree neighbors ranked by absolute correlation;\\\\pad from the top-MI half of \\(N\\setminus\\{i\\}\\) toward \\(\\min\\{20,\\lfloor n/3\\rfloor\\}\\).\\\\Each draw: reset \\(S\\gets B_i\\); drop each independently (\\(p=0.3\\)).\\\\Draw \\(a\\) uniformly from \\(\\{0,\\ldots,\\min(5,n-1)\\}\\);\\\\add \\(\\min\\{a,n-1-|S|\\}\\) absent features in random order."
    },
    {
      "text": "Both: m ← min(m, Δ<sub>i</sub>(S)), initialized at +1.<br/><b>Stop at -1</b> with a witness; else return m after K draws.<br/><b>K in {2, 5, 10, 25}</b> per feature per estimator.<br/>ISOLET uses {2,5,10}; removal uses the largest K.",
      "x": 1188.5249343832022,
      "y": 1525,
      "width": 1024.5249343832022,
      "height": 158.9999701120797,
      "font_size": 33,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 176,
      "latex": "Initialize \\(m\\gets+1\\); update \\(m\\gets\\min\\{m,\\Delta_i(S)\\}\\).\\\\\\textbf{Stop at \\(-1\\)} with a witness; else return \\(m\\) after \\(K\\) draws.\\\\\\(K\\in\\{2,5,10,25\\}\\) per feature per estimator.\\\\ISOLET: \\(K\\in\\{2,5,10\\}\\); removal uses the largest \\(K\\)."
    },
    {
      "text": "HYBRID DISPATCH",
      "x": 1212.5249343832022,
      "y": 1732,
      "width": 976.5249343832022,
      "height": 23.703103362391033,
      "font_size": 32,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 41,
      "latex": null
    },
    {
      "text": "n ≤ 20: exact  |  20 &lt; n ≤ 75: B*  |  n &gt; 75: min(A, B)",
      "x": 1212.5249343832022,
      "y": 1780,
      "width": 976.5249343832022,
      "height": 30.87599501867995,
      "font_size": 31,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 42,
      "latex": "\\(n\\leq20\\): exact\\quad|\\quad\\(20<n\\leq75\\): B*\\quad|\\quad\\(n>75\\): \\(\\min(A,B)\\)"
    },
    {
      "text": "*Use A if no correlation tree is available; min is featurewise.",
      "x": 1212.5249343832022,
      "y": 1822,
      "width": 976.5249343832022,
      "height": 26.088846824408467,
      "font_size": 30,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 38,
      "latex": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Validate joint removal",
      "x": 1212.5249343832022,
      "y": 1895,
      "width": 976.5249343832022,
      "height": 34.27196014943961,
      "font_size": 37,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 48,
      "latex": null
    },
    {
      "text": "H = {i: estimated MinPI<sub>i</sub> = -1}",
      "x": 1212.5249343832022,
      "y": 1940,
      "width": 976.5249343832022,
      "height": 46.32132503113325,
      "font_size": 34,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 52,
      "latex": "\\(\\displaystyle H=\\bigl\\{i\\in N:\\widehat{\\MinPI}_i=-1\\bigr\\}\\)"
    },
    {
      "text": "U<sub>val</sub>(N <font name=\"PosterMath\">∖</font> H) ≥ U<sub>val</sub>(N) - ε",
      "x": 1212.5249343832022,
      "y": 1994,
      "width": 976.5249343832022,
      "height": 42.13563138231632,
      "font_size": 42,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 58,
      "latex": "\\(\\displaystyle\\Uval(N\\setminus H)\\geq\\Uval(N)-\\varepsilon\\)"
    },
    {
      "text": "ε = 0.005 (classification); 0.01 (regression).<br/><b>PASS:</b> remove all H.  <b>FAIL:</b> keep all N.<br/>Test retained features; controls delete the removed count.",
      "x": 1212.5249343832022,
      "y": 2055,
      "width": 976.5249343832022,
      "height": 98.48091656288916,
      "font_size": 31,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 107,
      "latex": "\\(\\varepsilon=0.005\\) (classification); \\(0.01\\) (regression).\\\\Remove \\(R=H\\) on \\textbf{PASS}; \\(R=\\varnothing\\) on \\textbf{FAIL}.\\\\Test \\(S_{\\mathrm{ret}}=N\\setminus R\\) once; controls delete \\(k=|R|\\)."
    },
    {
      "text": "Optional MinPI-prefiltered NSGA-II",
      "x": 1212.5249343832022,
      "y": 2190,
      "width": 976.5249343832022,
      "height": 34.23582565379826,
      "font_size": 37,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 48,
      "latex": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Non-dominated sorting genetic algorithm II; minimize:",
      "x": 1212.5249343832022,
      "y": 2232,
      "width": 976.5249343832022,
      "height": 27.788054794520548,
      "font_size": 30,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 41,
      "latex": null
    },
    {
      "text": "(|S|/n, 1 - clip(U<sub>val</sub>(S), 0, 1))",
      "x": 1212.5249343832022,
      "y": 2272,
      "width": 976.5249343832022,
      "height": 90.89597011207971,
      "font_size": 38,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 94,
      "latex": "\\(\\displaystyle\\left(\\frac{|S|}{n},\\;1-\\operatorname{clip}\\!\\left(\\Uval(S),0,1\\right)\\right)\\)"
    },
    {
      "text": "n is shared: analyzed dimension before prefiltering.<br/>population 40; 800 evaluations per variant.<br/>HV reference (1.1, 1.1); select fronts on validation.<br/><b>Evaluate</b> the selected fronts on held-out test data.",
      "x": 1212.5249343832022,
      "y": 2380,
      "width": 976.5249343832022,
      "height": 118.93208468244086,
      "font_size": 31,
      "alignment": "left",
      "max_height": 125,
      "latex": null
    },
    {
